{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESEED</strong> is a precision platformer that tests both your skill and your memory. Your goal: guide each seed safely to the end of the level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The twist? While planning your route, the traps are hidden. You will need to remember their locations from memory and plan a safe path if you want the seed to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Memorize the traps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the level and learn the layout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ba36c99020a2bd374174fac7b8bc1b69.poster.avif?t=1756046186\" width=780 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ba36c99020a2bd374174fac7b8bc1b69.webm?t=1756046186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ba36c99020a2bd374174fac7b8bc1b69.mp4?t=1756046186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plan your route</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   Remember where the traps are hidden and map out a safe path entirely from memory so the seed can reach the goal unharmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ba0efd14dd92844cf450ac51e17d2af5.poster.avif?t=1756046186\" width=780 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ba0efd14dd92844cf450ac51e17d2af5.webm?t=1756046186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/ba0efd14dd92844cf450ac51e17d2af5.mp4?t=1756046186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch it unfold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the seed faithfully follows your planned route\u2026 for better or worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3221b9cea9d9a42c695e2b09e764041e.poster.avif?t=1756046186\" width=780 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3221b9cea9d9a42c695e2b09e764041e.webm?t=1756046186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3221b9cea9d9a42c695e2b09e764041e.mp4?t=1756046186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fail, Learn, Repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting it right the first time won\u2019t be easy. Learn from every mistake, refine your memory, and perfect your route.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save them all!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue every seed and return them to your ship to complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.poster.avif?t=1756046186\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/extras/3ccb92ea18cd893665ba514306f4d188.apng?t=1756046186\" class=\"bb_img\" width=115 height=137 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954440?t=1756046186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954440/fc75090e2ecf8161a297e559e1ee6aa7646a6e53/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1